# 基础词 Unit 18 短语

## 常考短语

- **have influence on/over**: 对…有影响 — Teachers have a great influence on students. 老师对学生有很大影响。
- **inform sb of/about**: 通知某人 — Please inform me of the decision. 请把决定通知我。
- **the initial stage**: 初始阶段 — The project is still in the initial stage. 项目仍处于初始阶段。
- **for instance**: 例如 — Many countries, for instance Japan, have aging populations. 许多国家，例如日本，人口正在老龄化。
- **gain insight into**: 深入了解 — The research provides insight into human behavior. 这项研究深入了解人类行为。
- **inspire sb to do sth**: 激励某人做某事 — His speech inspired the audience to take action. 他的演讲激励了听众采取行动。
- **an educational institution**: 教育机构 — The school is a respected educational institution. 这所学校是一个受人尊敬的教育机构。
- **follow instructions**: 遵循指示 — Please follow the instructions carefully. 请仔细遵循指示。
- **health insurance**: 健康保险 — She has comprehensive health insurance. 她有全面的健康保险。
- **integrate...into**: 把…融入 — The school integrates technology into the curriculum. 学校将技术融入课程。
- **intellectual property**: 知识产权 — The company protects its intellectual property. 公司保护其知识产权。
- **intend to do sth**: 打算做某事 — I intend to travel abroad next year. 我打算明年出国旅行。
- **interact with**: 与…互动 — Students should interact with each other in class. 学生在课堂上应该互相互动。
- **interpret...as**: 把…理解为 — His silence was interpreted as agreement. 他的沉默被理解为同意。
- **at intervals**: 不时地 — The trees are planted at regular intervals. 树木按规则间隔种植。
